            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Solution: Install a host server that runs Windows Server 2016 R2 Server Core. Add the Desktop Experience feature."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Does the solution meet the goal?"
          }
