    "Question #: 3": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-745 topic 1 question 40 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "DRAG DROP -"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You manage Microsoft system center virtual machine manager (SCVMM)."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to enable data deduplication for the SCVMM library server."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which action should you perform for each configuration options?"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "To answer drag the appropriate action to the correct condition."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Select and Place:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/03408/0007100001.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {},
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer:"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/03408/0007100002.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "MinimumFileAgeDays refers to the number of days after the file is created before the file is considered to be in-policy for optimization. You may want to modify this if you want Data Deduplication to be more aggressive."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Data Deduplication jobs are scheduled via Windows Task Scheduler and can be viewed and edited there under the path Microsoft\\Windows\\Deduplication. Data"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Deduplication includes several cmdlets that make scheduling easy. The most common reason for changing when Data Deduplication jobs run is to ensure that jobs run during off hours."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "ExcludeFileType is for file types that are excluded from optimization."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "ExcludeFolder specifies folder paths that should not be considered for optimization."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "References:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/storage/data-deduplication/advanced-settings"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "MinimumFileAgeDays refers to the number of days after the file is created before the file is considered to be in-policy for optimization. You may want to modify this if you want Data Deduplication to be more aggressive."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Data Deduplication jobs are scheduled via Windows Task Scheduler and can be viewed and edited there under the path Microsoft\\Windows\\Deduplication. Data"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Deduplication includes several cmdlets that make scheduling easy. The most common reason for changing when Data Deduplication jobs run is to ensure that jobs run during off hours."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "ExcludeFileType is for file types that are excluded from optimization."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "ExcludeFolder specifies folder paths that should not be considered for optimization."
          },
          {
